# Stray root artifacts — expo / tsc run from the monorepo root drops these
# stubs; the real files live in apps/mobile/ and tsconfig.base.json. Anchored
# to the root so they never shadow apps/mobile/app.json etc.
/app.json
/tsconfig.json

# Local research / release notes kept outside the repo.
#
# `/BigAd/` is 393 MB on disk. The rules below used to start at
# `/BigAd/docs/`, so everything AROUND docs/ was still eligible for
# `git add .` — and git cannot re-include a file whose parent directory is
# excluded, which is why this ignores `/BigAd/*` and then walks back down to
# the two guides rather than ignoring `/BigAd/` outright.
/BigAd/*
!/BigAd/docs/
/BigAd/docs/*
!/BigAd/docs/user-guide.md
!/BigAd/docs/pricing-guide.md
/Release-Checklist-48h.doc

# Local working directories and business data that have no reason to be in a
# git history. The spreadsheets are inventory pricing and a WooCommerce stock
# export — nothing in JUNO reads them, and a commit is permanent in a way a
# later `git rm` is not. Same list already excluded from the EAS build archive
# in apps/mobile/.easignore, for the same reasons.
/.tmp/
/.tools/
/*.xlsx
